Subject: [PATCH] Add no_retransform option to bypass Android SIGSEGV crash

---
 doc/configuration.md                          |  5 +++
 doc/troubleshooting.md                        | 31 +++++++++++++++
 src/main/java/org/unmojang/loki/Loki.java     | 39 ++++++++++++++-----
 src/main/java/org/unmojang/loki/LokiUtil.java | 19 ++++++---
 4 files changed, 79 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)

diff --git a/doc/configuration.md b/doc/configuration.md
index 2c8e904..44d0f9f 100644
--- a/doc/configuration.md
+++ b/doc/configuration.md
@@ -29,6 +29,11 @@ Loki supports JVM arguments to enable or disable some behaviour.
   -DLoki.disable_factory=true
   ```
 
+- Disable retransformation of already-loaded classes and appendToBootstrapClassLoaderSearch (for Android/non-standard JVMs, see [troubleshooting](troubleshooting.md#android-crash))
+  ```
+  -DLoki.no_retransform=true
+  ```
+
 - Disable username-based profile lookups [^1]
   ```
